WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
I don't want to be violent

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,480
You have to force me to use violence

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,320
Why can't you understand people?

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:14,420
Why don't you lie down for the two of you?

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,380
It's wrong to do it in broad daylight without worrying about points. It's not wrong.

6
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,910
Yes, yes, there are more mistakes

7
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:20,590
A certain family is the most reasonable

8
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:23,070
Next time, if a certain family catches you and bullies good people,

9
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:27,950
I don’t mind having a good chat with you guys. Brother Guo, I’m sorry.

10
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:29,150
The battle just now was dangerous

11
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,190
Someone is afraid of hurting you

12
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:32,230
It’s only through heaven that you can escape

13
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,030
Next time, don't throw it away again

14
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:36,230
My heart is about to be thrown out of my throat by you.

15
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:46,030
Your two wild pig loin companions

16
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:49,510
We were taken care of by the violent barbarians wearing mountains of clothing.

17
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,370
God's way is reincarnation, heaven

18
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:55,970
Riding three dead horses to make fun of me

19
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:56,970
You also have today

20
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:58,050
I laughed so hard

21
00:00:58,050 --> 00:00:59,210
Two big fat pigs
